cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result records, please cite the article below."
title: "SR-Audit: skill-floor audit code and result records for satellite super-resolution"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and released result records for a skill-floor audit of
  satellite super-resolution evaluation. Every reported gain is paired with the
  zero-information baseline floor (what a constant spatial-mean predictor already
  achieves) and with the captured share beta, so that gains produced by a collapsed
  bicubic baseline can be separated from recovered information. Includes the five
  SR-Audit gates (G1-G5), the scale-isolation experiment, and independent
  re-implementations of four published methods.
